8. MASTER SUMMARY
============================================================

CART is a coordinate-free algebra that:
- resolves relational tension (K),
- measures residual tension (D),
- forms identity classes (C/K),
- and organizes them by entanglement depth (H),
all over a raw relational field (C).

It is the unified substrate for relational tension analysis
in the 511.3 mathematical framework.


